rces.approval] table-header which @iarna/toml flattens as sibling key, NOT per-source override; inline-table form required; fix in docs-examples t_310c0ec1", "loader test toml-loader.test.ts:308-313 for per-source approval is tautological (perSourceApproval always initialized to {}); add real positive test when approval-engine t_c857745f lands", "audit_max_bytes naming ambiguity in example; defer to audit-log card t_67320e65"], "read_only_compliance": "no producer/other-worktree files modified; no destructive commands; no sudo", "worker_session_id": "20260526_102332_fbd854"}', NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO 'task_runs'('id', 'task_id', 'profile', 'step_key', 'status', 'claim_lock', 'claim_expires', 'worker_pid', 'max_runtime_seconds', 'last_heartbeat_at', 'started_at', 'ended_at', 'outcome', 'summary', 'metadata', 'error') VALUES (14, 't_66e61c98', 'reviewer', NULL, 'done', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2700, NULL, 1779762210, 1779762334, 'completed', 'Sibling review of audit-log producer t_67320e65: PASS. Verified all 6 acceptance criteria against worktree code (default ~/.ssh-mcp, JSONL append, 10MB size-roll, day-roll, retain 10, redactor for password/PEM/AWS/JWT shapes, stdout/stderr UTF-8-safe cap with truncated flag, audit-write failure non-fatal). Re-ran vitest on audit __tests__ + openssh.unit (28/28 passed). YELLOW (non-blocking): no strict-mode toggle for audit failures, TOML wiring deferred to toml-config card (env-var fallback covers operators). Conclusions posted to both t_29114a14 (governance trace) and t_67320e65 (producer).', '{"verdict": "PASS", "yellow_caveats": ["audit-write strict-mode not implemented (best-effort only)", "TOML audit_dir/audit_max_bytes wiring TODO at src/index.ts:120 pending toml-config card; env-var fallback in place"], "files_reviewed": ["src/audit/types.ts", "src/audit/redactor.ts", "src/audit/store.ts", "src/audit/rotator.ts", "src/audit/__tests__/redactor.test.ts", "src/audit/__tests__/store.test.ts", "src/audit/__tests__/rotator.test.ts", "src/audit/__tests__/integration.test.ts", "src/index.ts (audit wiring)"], "tests_executed": "npx vitest --run src/audit/__tests__ test/openssh.unit.test.ts → 5 files / 28 tests passed", "producer_test_claim_accepted": "npm test 86/86 (per developer-general handoff comment)", "worker_session_id": "20260526_102332_2d5288"}', NULL);
