secrets in static assets (token input is type=password, autocomplete=off)", "synchronous boot-time throw for non-loopback bind without authToken (server.ts:130-134)", "Bearer + X-Auth-Token header on /api/*, ?token= query for SSE", "tests use FakeQueue/FakeAudit/fakeRegistry — no real SSH or remote commands"], "worker_session_id": "20260526_102332_8e4dcd"}', NULL);
